&lt;p&gt;For more advanced integrations, combine badges with the full &lt;a href="https://minecraft-serverhub.com/developers" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;status API&lt;/a&gt;. The badge gives you a visual indicator, while the API gives you raw data for custom displays:&lt;br&gt;
